I went into my archives of materials and found an audio tape I recorded several years ago called The World of Holography.

7
00:00:50,320 --> 00:01:03,840
It covers the history of holography, how lasers work, it defines the types and styles of holograms, and looks at where holography is at present and where it could be going in the future.

8
