Okay, so here is the world of holography in its entirety.

14
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:51,760
I won't be coming on after the presentation, so I will say thank you for tuning in.

15
00:01:51,760 --> 00:02:00,840
And don't forget to tune in each and every week when HoloTalk brings you another new show right on your own computer anywhere in the world.

16
